### IntelliJ IDEA ###
# IntelliJ is "radio-controlled" by the Maven project (pom.xml), so the IDE's own
# config is regenerated on import and must not be shared. Only files that Maven
# cannot produce are kept under version control:
#   - .idea/.gitignore  (IDE housekeeping overrides, e.g. workspace.xml)
#   - .idea/vcs.xml     (VCS root mapping - not covered by Maven)
.idea/misc.xml
.idea/encodings.xml
.idea/workspace.xml
.idea/modules.xml
.idea/jarRepositories.xml
.idea/compiler.xml
.idea/libraries/
*.iws
*.iml
*.ipr

